  "evidence": "The study systematically reviewed preclinical animal models of sepsis to evaluate the efficacy of mesenchymal stem cell (MSC) therapy prior to initiating a first-in-human trial. All reported measurements are within-animal comparisons (e.g., MSC therapy vs. control treatment in preclinical animal models of sepsis). There are no direct comparisons between animal results and human outcomes.",
